00:16:11.450 --> 00:16:12.400
Yeah! Yeah!

00:16:13.450 --> 00:16:15.700
Oh! I can't see anything!

00:16:15.700 --> 00:16:19.410
Okay, now spin. One. Two.

00:16:20.120 --> 00:16:23.330
Three. Four. Five.

00:16:24.210 --> 00:16:25.000
Matsuri-chan!

00:16:26.040 --> 00:16:27.290
